#: ../../tutorials/programmatic-build.md:1
msgid "教程：用 build.yaml 与 Python API 构建"
msgstr "Tutorial: Build with build.yaml and the Python API"

#: ../../tutorials/programmatic-build.md:3
msgid "TUI 适合交互式构建，脚本和 CI 则用一份严格的 YAML 构建定义加 Python API。仓库的 `examples/minimal-finite-element/build.yaml` 是完整的最小例子（两点、两通道）。"
msgstr "The TUI suits interactive building; scripts and CI use one strict YAML build definition plus the Python API. `examples/minimal-finite-element/build.yaml` in the repository is a complete minimal example (two points, two channels)."

#: ../../tutorials/programmatic-build.md:5
msgid "构建定义长什么样"
msgstr "What the build definition looks like"

#: ../../tutorials/programmatic-build.md:61
msgid "字段含义（单位、形状、顺序约束）见[格式契约](../reference/format-contracts)和[概念](../concepts/units-and-formats)；JSON Schema 投影是机器校验的权威。"
msgstr "Field meanings (units, shapes, ordering constraints) are in [Reference: format contracts](../reference/format-contracts) and [Concepts](../concepts/units-and-formats); the JSON Schema projection is the authority for machine validation."

#: ../../tutorials/programmatic-build.md:63
msgid "加载并构建"
msgstr "Load and build"

#: ../../tutorials/programmatic-build.md:82
msgid "`report` 是 `BuildReport`，包含输出目录、包身份、点数、通道数、响应形状与秩、响应内存字节数和物理模式（`fixed` 或 `dynamic_geometry`）。"
msgstr "`report` is a `BuildReport` containing the output directory, package identity, point count, channel count, response shape and rank, response memory in bytes, and the physics mode (`fixed` or `dynamic_geometry`)."

#: ../../tutorials/programmatic-build.md:84
msgid "构建失败时"
msgstr "When a build fails"

#: ../../tutorials/programmatic-build.md:86
msgid "异常是结构化的 `MagshieldEnvError`，携带 `type`、`subtype`、`message` 和可执行的 `hint`。按提示修复声明或源文件后重试；不要改一个不同的物理模型来碰运气。常见修复路径见[操作指南：排查](../how-to/troubleshooting)。"
msgstr "The exception is a structured `MagshieldEnvError` carrying `type`, `subtype`, `message`, and an actionable `hint`. Fix the declaration or source file and retry; do not switch to a different physical model to get lucky. Common fixes: [How-to: troubleshooting](../how-to/troubleshooting)."

#: ../../tutorials/programmatic-build.md:88
msgid "导出后的双保险"
msgstr "Double check after export"

#: ../../tutorials/programmatic-build.md:97
msgid "`validate_environment` 校验每个文件哈希、数组身份和跨文件契约。之后再用 `make_env` 加载并执行一次 step，见[教程：校验、导出并加载](../tutorials/validate-load)。"
msgstr "`validate_environment` checks every file hash, array identity, and cross-file contract. Then load once with `make_env` and take one step; see [Tutorial: validate, export, and load](../tutorials/validate-load)."
